          "text": "Description: On March 7, 2012, around noon, a witness was intrigued by the passage in the sky of a commercial jet followed by three objects forming a triangle. The objects were very close to the tail of the jet and they interchanged their positions behind the commercial jet. The observer witnessed an exceptional maneuver of military aircraft. The detailed explanation is provided in the attached document (radar trace). This case is classified \"A\": observation of military aerial maneuvers.",
